		{"id":"539820a4eaaecd58","type":"text","text":"Welcome to the mothership [one.yoso.one](http://one.yoso.one/)\n\nBy subscribing to the newsletter, you can expect updates from [Yoso](http://one.yoso.one/), the core of my thinking and artwork produced for various projects including Tattooing, creative ideas; research and collaborations, drops, and releases.\n\n**Independent - private news - from the ground**  \n  \nYoso respects your privacy.\n\nIf you are active on the public networks,  \nyou can connect with Yoso at the following.\n\n### Recommended\n\n[Mastodon](https://mastodon.social/@Yosoone) - Direct  \n[are.na](http://are.na/)\n\nTransient  \n[Newsletter on Yoso Tattoo](https://tattoo.yoso.eu/newsletter)  \n[Substack](https://yosoone.substack.com/profile/posts)\n\n**Some of my work in progress**  \n[Shinsei](https://yoso.one/)  \n[Tattoo](https://tattoo.yoso.eu/)  \n[https://108.yoso.one/](https://108.yoso.one/)  \n[Black and white photography](https://kuro.yoso.one/)\n\n**Insta**  \n[Tattoo](https://www.instagram.com/yosotattoo/)  \n[Photography](https://www.instagram.com/yosokuro/)  \n[Brush work](https://www.instagram.com/yoso.one/)  \n[yo punk](https://www.instagram.com/y.o.p.u.n.k/)\n\n### Patrons\n\n_Exclusive on request_  \n[Zotero](https://www.zotero.org/yosoone)","x":-660,"y":-180,"width":660,"height":880},
